# Flutter Coding

- Match existing conventions in `lib/core/` and feature folders
- Use `ConsumerWidget` / `ConsumerStatefulWidget` with Riverpod
- Prefer const constructors where possible
- Accessibility: semantic labels on interactive elements
- German UI copy
- Minimize scope: focused diffs, no unrelated refactors
